Alternative: Data Structures and Algorithms in Java

Author: Robert Lafore
 Priority: Alternative, not an additional required book

Choose Lafore instead of Weiss if you prefer diagrams and implementation-first teaching. It is generally regarded as accessible and particularly appropriate for Java learners.

Do not read both Weiss and Lafore completely. Pick one:

Choose Weiss for stronger analysis and academic depth.
Choose Lafore for visual, implementation-oriented explanations.
