Phase 6: Final Interview Preparation
9. Cracking the Coding Interview

Author: Gayle Laakmann McDowell
 Level: Interview Ready
 Time: 3 to 4 weeks
 Priority: Interview-process preparation

Use this near the end, not as your first DSA book. It is commonly recommended specifically for coding interviews.

Focus on
Interview preparation strategy
Behavioral preparation
Big-O review
Arrays and strings
Linked lists
Stacks and queues
