Why read it last?

Its main value is interview framing, communication, and practice. The earlier books provide the deeper DSA foundation.

10. Programming Interviews Exposed

Priority: Optional alternative

Use this if you want additional mock-interview-style questions and explanation practice. Do not read both this and Cracking the Coding Interview cover to cover unless you have sufficient preparation time.

